  // cannot say where it was written is a backup nobody can restore. The key
  // is chosen by the SERVER (`buildBackupStorageKey`), never by a caller.
  storageProvider String @map("storage_provider")
  storageKey      String @map("storage_key")
  bucket          String

  // `pg_dump`'s archive format — `custom` (`-Fc`) for everything this
  // repository writes. Stored so a future format change does not make old
  // archives unreadable-by-inspection: `pg_restore` needs to know, and
